    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d849">

                <pb facs="0787" n="671" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg671"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/14583.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Special Agent Silliman to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Vera Cruz</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-03-12T17:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 12, 1915—5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s March 11, 6 p.m., received and understood. Am sure the plan proposed
                    would remove what appears to be annoyance. I will give my best effort in the
                    line suggested.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Silliman.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
